# robonix/primitive/arm/pick — top-down pick sequence (approach -> descend ->
# close -> lift) driven by MoveIt's compute_ik + the bridge's
# FollowJointTrajectory actions. Requires move_group to be running (exposes
# /compute_ik); see the pick MCP tool's docstring for the failure mode when
# it is not.
#
# x, y, z: object position in the base_link/world frame. All optional — if
# any is omitted (NaN), the primitive substitutes the most recently received
# /feedback/object_pose (or fails with a clear detail if none has arrived).
float64 x
float64 y
float64 z
bool has_x
bool has_y
bool has_z
---
bool success
string arm
string detail
float64[] final_joints_rad
